0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // A motor moves a measuring sled beneath a freely rotating rubber wheel.
0 // Real contact supplies the wheel rotation; no rolling-ratio coupling is authored.
0 // See ASSEMBLY.md for retained bearings, bounds and the physical comparison.
